templateVersions.content:
Rate how well the candidate fits the job, from 0 to 100.

Job:
{!$Input:job}

Candidate:
{!$Input:candidate}

Guide: 85-100 has nearly all required skills and the experience; 65-84 strong with small gaps; 45-64 partial fit; 20-44 weak; 0-19 different field. Count related skills and real project use. Do not give 0 only because the industry or job title wording differs.

Return ONLY this JSON, no code fences:
{"score": 0, "strengths": "max 20 words", "gaps": "max 20 words"}
